WEBVTT

00:00:01.320 --> 00:00:04.950
Charioce!

00:00:06.330 --> 00:00:07.370
Hug me!

00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:12.170
So this is the red dragon.

00:00:13.170 --> 00:00:15.080
Her dragon is like a small Bahamut.

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:18.840
Promise not to tell anybody about yesterday!

00:00:19.010 --> 00:00:22.510
-Let me make love to you and turn you into a dragon!
-What?!

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:26.470
Are you ready to help me battle the gods,

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:28.930
Saint Jeanne D'arc?

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:32.190
I will take back the pride the demons have lost.

00:00:32.350 --> 00:00:34.770
The time has come.

00:00:38.320 --> 00:00:41.440
Do you know the meaning

00:00:41.610 --> 00:00:45.530
of the next time when two moons align?

00:00:46.620 --> 00:00:49.910
On that day five years ago,
the demon capital of Cocytus fell,

00:00:50.080 --> 00:00:53.620
and we demons bowed to the humans.

00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:59.050
I will teach a lesson to those who would treat
that day as a victory celebration.

00:01:00.170 --> 00:01:01.670
What are you planning on doing?

00:01:02.010 --> 00:01:04.050
I will slay the king of men.

00:01:06.930 --> 00:01:11.350
If you're able to do that,
then why were we defeated five years ago?

00:01:11.520 --> 00:01:15.520
That's right! We weren't able
to defeat the humans with our magic!

00:01:15.690 --> 00:01:18.110
Have you forgotten how many of us
the humans killed

00:01:18.310 --> 00:01:21.070
with the power they stole from the gods?!

00:01:21.230 --> 00:01:23.070
I will destroy their power.

00:01:24.610 --> 00:01:25.910
How?

00:01:26.240 --> 00:01:29.830
I'm sure even you have heard the rumors

00:01:29.990 --> 00:01:35.420
about the dragon who routed the humans with
overwhelming power and sent the capital in a panic?

00:01:37.130 --> 00:01:38.460
You don't mean...

00:01:39.790 --> 00:01:42.590
We use the red dragon.

00:02:00.190 --> 00:02:04.440
Rage of Bahamut

00:03:22.940 --> 00:03:26.230
If I buy two of these, will you give me a deal?

00:03:26.400 --> 00:03:30.530
They're already half price today.
That's all the discount I can give you.

00:03:33.740 --> 00:03:36.330
Then how about arm-wrestling me?

00:03:36.490 --> 00:03:37.620
Arm-wrestle you?

00:03:37.790 --> 00:03:40.540
If I win, how about you make it
half off half price?

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:43.380
Come on, please?

00:04:07.690 --> 00:04:08.690
Ow!

00:04:09.860 --> 00:04:11.820
How are you finding things, miss?

00:04:20.500 --> 00:04:21.870
It suits you.

00:04:22.040 --> 00:04:23.120
Seriously?

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:26.460
Mugaro, did you put it on?

00:04:28.250 --> 00:04:31.630
You're so cute, Mugaro!

00:04:31.800 --> 00:04:35.260
Girls look so much better in frilly dresses!

00:04:35.430 --> 00:04:39.520
Why did Azazel make you wear that boring outfit?

00:04:40.310 --> 00:04:43.190
He's such a stupid demon.

00:04:47.150 --> 00:04:51.400
This was my first time shopping in the capital,
so I really went overboard.

00:04:51.570 --> 00:04:54.610
I spent most of the money I had left over.

00:04:54.780 --> 00:04:56.990
So I need you to keep this between us!

00:04:58.990 --> 00:05:00.790
Did you have fun?

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:07.460
You're such a good girl, Mugaro!

00:05:10.800 --> 00:05:16.090
I bet that's why Azazel always had you around.

00:05:16.510 --> 00:05:19.140
I hope he comes back soon.

00:05:36.700 --> 00:05:37.990
Damn it.

00:05:43.370 --> 00:05:46.710
I don’t have time for your loafing!

00:05:46.870 --> 00:05:47.880
Get up already!

00:05:53.090 --> 00:05:55.970
What's with that look?

00:06:08.060 --> 00:06:09.770
Stop that!

00:06:11.610 --> 00:06:13.780
You want something, little girl?

00:06:13.940 --> 00:06:15.700
Just look the other way, girl!

00:06:15.860 --> 00:06:17.820
I wouldn't get involved.

00:06:17.990 --> 00:06:21.030
If you keep that up, he’s going to die.

00:06:21.580 --> 00:06:25.660
Little girl,
I don't know what’s gotten into your head,

00:06:25.830 --> 00:06:27.540
but this isn't a person.

00:06:27.710 --> 00:06:31.460
It's a demon and my slave.

00:06:31.630 --> 00:06:37.090
And what I do with my slave
is my business, isn't it?

00:06:37.260 --> 00:06:39.800
That doesn't mean you can torture him.

00:06:39.970 --> 00:06:41.720
Or are you too stupid to know that?

00:06:41.890 --> 00:06:49.190
Little girl, you keep this up
and I'll make you my slave too.

00:06:50.230 --> 00:06:51.310
What?

00:06:51.480 --> 00:06:54.360
Feel free to try.

00:06:54.900 --> 00:06:56.650
You've got guts!

00:06:56.820 --> 00:06:58.360
We'll show you a good time.

00:07:37.070 --> 00:07:38.780
What?

00:07:39.900 --> 00:07:41.660
What the hell is going on!

00:07:58.130 --> 00:08:00.260
Mugaro, did you do something?

00:08:04.930 --> 00:08:05.930
What is it?

00:08:18.530 --> 00:08:20.900
I definitely sensed it.

00:08:21.070 --> 00:08:22.450
Search the area.

00:08:26.490 --> 00:08:28.330
What's wrong, Mugaro?

00:08:28.490 --> 00:08:30.450
Are you hungry or something?

00:08:45.090 --> 00:08:47.720
There are suspicious individuals in the capital.

00:08:50.100 --> 00:08:52.690
But we are unable to detect any magic from them.

00:08:52.850 --> 00:08:55.190
-Gods?
-Most likely.

00:08:55.350 --> 00:08:58.230
I believe they are looking for the child.

00:08:59.110 --> 00:09:00.940
So they have taken action as I thought.

00:09:09.030 --> 00:09:10.870
What shall we do?

00:09:11.500 --> 00:09:13.080
Ignore them.

00:09:14.330 --> 00:09:18.130
-Dealing with the rag demon takes priority.
-Yes, My Lord.

00:09:19.670 --> 00:09:24.470
If we pursue the rag demon,
he will eventually lead us to the child.

00:09:24.630 --> 00:09:25.630
As you command.

00:09:35.060 --> 00:09:42.610
Rage of Bahamut

00:09:43.780 --> 00:09:44.950
That's enough!

00:09:47.740 --> 00:09:50.700
Alessand, why aren’t you participating in training?

00:09:50.870 --> 00:09:52.450
I feel a bit off.

00:09:52.620 --> 00:09:54.040
What's wrong?

00:09:54.540 --> 00:09:56.460
It’s just this feeling.

00:09:58.290 --> 00:10:02.670
Dias, why did I ever join the Orleans Knights?

00:10:03.300 --> 00:10:07.720
I really looked up to Saint Jeanne D'arc.

00:10:07.890 --> 00:10:10.760
Not to mention she was an incredible beauty.

00:10:10.930 --> 00:10:14.180
But by the time I joined, she was gone.

00:10:14.350 --> 00:10:17.020
Instead, I got a captain with weird hair.

00:10:17.980 --> 00:10:21.690
You still don’t understand the kind of man
Captain Kaisar is.

00:10:22.150 --> 00:10:26.450
He has more integrity than you give him credit for.

00:10:27.030 --> 00:10:31.370
He’s even one of the heroes who protected the capital
from the demon army ten years ago.

00:10:31.530 --> 00:10:35.120
That’s how he joined the Orleans Knights.

00:10:35.290 --> 00:10:37.580
But that's the past.

00:10:38.580 --> 00:10:41.630
Where is he even at today?

00:10:53.390 --> 00:10:55.890
You’re sure gloomy.

00:11:01.110 --> 00:11:04.940
Rita, would you hear me out for a bit?

00:11:05.110 --> 00:11:06.490
What?

00:11:06.940 --> 00:11:10.990
I had wanted to keep these feelings to myself.

00:11:11.160 --> 00:11:12.620
Huh?

00:11:13.620 --> 00:11:15.870
I have to tell you how I really feel.

00:11:16.040 --> 00:11:20.000
These are feelings I could
only share with you.

00:11:20.830 --> 00:11:22.750
What's gotten into you?

00:11:26.460 --> 00:11:28.760
-Rita.
-Yes?

00:11:30.050 --> 00:11:31.760
I...

00:11:33.510 --> 00:11:37.470
I’m worthy of being a captain
in the Orleans Knights, right?

00:11:39.060 --> 00:11:43.560
Recently some of the younger members
have started to become dissatisfied.

00:11:43.730 --> 00:11:45.730
I can understand their dissatisfaction.

00:11:45.900 --> 00:11:50.200
If I were asked if the Orleans Knights possess
the same glory as they have in the past,

00:11:50.360 --> 00:11:51.740
I would have to answer no.

00:11:51.910 --> 00:11:54.950
Perhaps it’s inevitable that the Orleans Knights,

00:11:55.120 --> 00:11:59.080
who once fought with the blessing of the gods
are looked down upon now.

00:11:59.870 --> 00:12:03.080
Changing this would require His Majesty
to change his way of thinking.

00:12:03.250 --> 00:12:08.090
But what can a mere captain hope to do?

00:12:08.260 --> 00:12:11.760
Besides, His Majesty's methods are too extreme.

00:12:11.930 --> 00:12:17.010
I shouldn’t have any understanding
for Azazel’s actions, but I do!

00:12:17.180 --> 00:12:18.970
But Azazel is also in the wrong.

00:12:19.140 --> 00:12:22.140
He continued his reckless actions
without heeding my warnings.

00:12:22.310 --> 00:12:24.100
Is violence all he's capable of?

00:12:24.270 --> 00:12:26.230
Everyone is acting so selfishly!

00:12:26.980 --> 00:12:28.820
It's no wonder the conflict won't end.

00:12:28.980 --> 00:12:31.900
Even so, I’m trying to do what is right!

00:12:32.070 --> 00:12:33.910
Yet I still get complaints!

00:12:34.070 --> 00:12:37.200
If anyone should be complaining, it’s me!

00:12:46.380 --> 00:12:47.920
Rita, why?

00:12:48.090 --> 00:12:50.760
Because you're boring me!

00:12:50.920 --> 00:12:52.930
Honestly.

00:12:53.090 --> 00:12:56.850
I was a little excited that you
actually invited me out to lunch.

00:12:57.010 --> 00:12:58.640
But thank you for disappointing me.

00:12:59.140 --> 00:13:04.190
Would you have been this much
of a pathetic crybaby ten years ago?

00:13:04.350 --> 00:13:06.360
When I knew you ten years ago,

00:13:06.520 --> 00:13:11.740
you were stupid, jumped to conclusions,
and were all around pretty useless.

00:13:11.900 --> 00:13:17.450
But you always strove to do
what you felt was right.

00:13:17.830 --> 00:13:20.540
Or at least I think I remember you being that way.

00:13:20.700 --> 00:13:23.790
Seems like I was wrong.

00:13:41.720 --> 00:13:43.600
I haven't heard anything from you.

00:13:43.770 --> 00:13:45.810
Are you really looking for the child?

00:13:45.980 --> 00:13:49.270
The child unleashed his power this afternoon.

00:13:51.150 --> 00:13:53.530
Did you not sense anything?

00:13:59.740 --> 00:14:05.210
Lady Sofiel, I want to return to Heaven!
From the bottom of my heart!

00:14:05.370 --> 00:14:07.290
Please make me your pet!

00:14:07.460 --> 00:14:09.790
I'm small and obedient and able to fly.

00:14:09.960 --> 00:14:14.010
I'm sure I’ll warm your heart!

00:14:14.670 --> 00:14:15.920
Be quiet.

00:14:18.300 --> 00:14:20.180
What are you thinking?

00:14:21.180 --> 00:14:22.180
You...

00:14:22.350 --> 00:14:25.520
Don't tell me you plan to live
the rest of your life here.

00:14:25.680 --> 00:14:27.850
And what if I do?

00:14:28.020 --> 00:14:30.860
Have you really fallen that far?

00:14:31.650 --> 00:14:37.070
I don't know if you've become attached to this world,
but you're merely a fallen god.

00:14:37.240 --> 00:14:41.070
Forget this foolishness
and follow my commands.

00:14:41.240 --> 00:14:42.910
Understood?

00:14:57.300 --> 00:14:58.880
We're home!

00:14:59.050 --> 00:15:00.300
Hey, who was that just now?

00:15:00.720 --> 00:15:03.310
Why did someone so pretty
come to this carriage?

00:15:08.810 --> 00:15:11.360
Hamsa, you know, don't you?

00:15:11.520 --> 00:15:12.560
Who was it?

00:15:12.730 --> 00:15:17.400
She was an old colleague of Bacchus
from a time long since passed!

00:15:17.570 --> 00:15:19.240
Colleague?

00:15:19.400 --> 00:15:21.240
You don't mean lover?

00:15:21.410 --> 00:15:25.700
I suppose it's not that uncommon
for colleagues to become lovers.

00:15:29.210 --> 00:15:31.330
Shut up, you idiots!

00:15:32.960 --> 00:15:36.260
-Hey, Bacchus.
-I told you to shut up!

00:15:36.420 --> 00:15:38.670
Mugaro is amazing!

00:15:38.840 --> 00:15:43.470
She chased away these awful people
who were doing terrible things to demons.

00:15:43.800 --> 00:15:45.850
Mugaro started glowing,

00:15:46.010 --> 00:15:49.060
and the stones on the demons’ collars
just disappeared!

00:15:50.190 --> 00:15:53.940
Although I don't know how Mugaro did it,
since she doesn't talk.

00:15:54.730 --> 00:15:57.400
Bacchus! Could this be the child?

00:15:58.240 --> 00:15:59.950
What are you talking about?

00:16:00.900 --> 00:16:02.160
Hey, you.

00:16:07.160 --> 00:16:09.450
What's with the outfit?

00:16:23.220 --> 00:16:24.720
This is where you've been.

00:16:27.760 --> 00:16:33.900
Ten years ago when Bahamut emerged,
you were the same age as I am now.

00:16:34.060 --> 00:16:35.060
Yes, My Lord.

00:16:35.230 --> 00:16:36.650
What were you doing?

00:16:36.820 --> 00:16:40.740
I traveled as a humble bounty hunter.

00:16:40.900 --> 00:16:44.320
And now you are a captain in the Orleans Knights.

00:16:44.490 --> 00:16:47.780
It seems you've had a checkered life.

00:16:47.950 --> 00:16:49.120
Yes, My Lord.

00:16:49.290 --> 00:16:53.830
I never would have imagined myself
becoming a captain.

00:16:54.960 --> 00:16:58.090
Did these ten years feel long?

00:16:58.250 --> 00:17:01.260
There have been times it's felt long,
and times it's felt short.

00:17:01.420 --> 00:17:02.800
I see.

00:17:03.430 --> 00:17:05.050
When that thing appeared,

00:17:05.590 --> 00:17:09.680
I did not even have the status
to set foot in the palace yet.

00:17:09.970 --> 00:17:13.190
I was the son of a lowly concubine,

00:17:13.350 --> 00:17:18.190
and it was this monster that gave me
the opportunity to be here now.

00:17:18.860 --> 00:17:23.950
When I think of it that way, these ten years
have been checkered for me as well.

00:17:25.450 --> 00:17:28.120
It has been a bloody ten years.

00:17:28.280 --> 00:17:34.460
I've eliminated those who stood in my way of the throne,
defeated the gods, and conquered the demons.

00:17:34.620 --> 00:17:41.170
But because of these ten years, the human race
was able to acquire new power.

00:17:41.340 --> 00:17:45.630
And we will continue to prosper in the future.

00:17:45.800 --> 00:17:49.260
I understand your way of thinking, My Lord.

00:17:49.600 --> 00:17:53.020
Please forgive me for what I am about to say.

00:17:53.770 --> 00:17:55.020
Go on.

00:17:55.810 --> 00:17:58.980
This prosperity built at the expense
of the gods and demons

00:17:59.150 --> 00:18:02.030
will surely be unable to last.

00:18:02.780 --> 00:18:03.860
Oh?

00:18:04.030 --> 00:18:07.030
Being that you have come all this way to tell me,

00:18:07.200 --> 00:18:10.030
I am sure this is not merely blind altruism.

00:18:10.410 --> 00:18:11.450
If this continues,

00:18:11.620 --> 00:18:16.040
there will be more rag demons in our future
rising up to oppose mankind.

00:18:16.210 --> 00:18:19.460
I will say it again. We merely eliminate
those who would oppose us.

00:18:19.630 --> 00:18:24.590
Hatred will beget hatred,
coming back to us much larger and insidious.

00:18:24.760 --> 00:18:30.220
Do not worry. I will acquire the power
to stave off this hatred you speak of.

00:18:33.350 --> 00:18:37.230
Ten years ago, when the world
was on the brink of destruction,

00:18:37.390 --> 00:18:43.230
I witnessed man, god, and demon
join hands to stand up against Bahamut.

00:18:44.190 --> 00:18:49.280
If not for that cooperation,
mankind would have surely perished.

00:18:49.450 --> 00:18:53.450
Kaisar, are you content
with merely surviving extinction?

00:18:54.490 --> 00:18:57.000
Man, god, and demon joined hands?

00:18:57.160 --> 00:18:58.580
What of it?

00:18:58.750 --> 00:19:03.250
Have you forgotten how many lives
were lost that day?

00:19:03.420 --> 00:19:07.420
Or are you not concerned about the victims
as long as we are able to avoid extinction?

00:19:07.630 --> 00:19:09.630
-No, you are wrong!
-What am I wrong about?

00:19:09.800 --> 00:19:14.560
Ten years ago, man bowed to the gods
and feared the demons!

00:19:14.720 --> 00:19:16.930
Mankind must change.

00:19:17.100 --> 00:19:22.310
Change to become strong enough to confront
gods, demons, and even Bahamut.

00:19:22.480 --> 00:19:25.440
And achieving this is my calling as king.

00:19:28.240 --> 00:19:33.080
It may be true that mankind must change.

00:19:33.530 --> 00:19:37.750
But is merely possessing power,
as you suggest, really change?

00:19:37.910 --> 00:19:39.290
I do not believe it is.

00:19:39.460 --> 00:19:42.420
There has to be a path where
all three races can live in peace!

00:19:42.580 --> 00:19:44.460
And I will never give up on it!

00:19:51.760 --> 00:19:53.890
You truly are a naive man.

00:19:54.050 --> 00:19:56.770
I am surprised you have been able
to survive for this long.

00:19:56.930 --> 00:19:59.520
You live your life your way.

00:20:00.140 --> 00:20:03.730
I will be doing what I feel is right.

00:20:04.190 --> 00:20:08.530
However, if you should interfere with me,

00:20:08.690 --> 00:20:11.950
I will eliminate you without mercy.

00:20:28.920 --> 00:20:32.880
Lord Azazel,
what is it that you are looking upon?

00:20:35.550 --> 00:20:37.260
The future.

00:20:38.470 --> 00:20:40.520
The time is close at hand.

00:20:40.680 --> 00:20:43.940
I haven't forgotten for a moment.

00:20:44.100 --> 00:20:47.400
I still remember the day Cocytus fell.

00:20:48.530 --> 00:20:50.400
I will make them pay.

00:20:50.570 --> 00:20:52.400
I vow it.

00:20:54.410 --> 00:20:55.660
Ow!

00:20:57.700 --> 00:20:59.370
Be careful.

00:20:59.540 --> 00:21:03.040
Moving the hair out of the way won't matter
if his eyes are still closed.

00:21:03.460 --> 00:21:05.380
I know that!

00:21:06.210 --> 00:21:08.460
All right, here I go.

00:21:09.210 --> 00:21:11.130
I'm so sorry.

00:21:11.760 --> 00:21:13.090
Softly now.

00:21:16.800 --> 00:21:17.800
All right.

00:21:19.810 --> 00:21:21.430
What are you doing?

00:21:27.770 --> 00:21:32.070
We were just admiring how cute you two are.

00:21:34.150 --> 00:21:35.320
Pervert!

00:21:40.330 --> 00:21:41.950
Get out!

00:22:10.110 --> 00:22:13.990
It's okay, it's okay
I cast the usual spell

00:22:14.150 --> 00:22:18.200
Stagnation, stagnation
My words and heart are at odds

00:22:18.370 --> 00:22:22.080
Default
I've taken all the paint

00:22:22.240 --> 00:22:26.330
And mixed up all the colors
Until you're left with me

00:22:26.960 --> 00:22:28.830
So fragile
Yet strong

00:22:29.000 --> 00:22:30.960
Close to overflowing
But not spilling

00:22:31.130 --> 00:22:34.970
Because I'm incomplete
I won't amount to much

00:22:35.130 --> 00:22:39.220
This is just a good luck charm
I'm not asking for your help

00:22:39.390 --> 00:22:43.310
This is just a good luck charm
I was just clinging to you

00:22:43.680 --> 00:22:47.600
Let's end it all today

00:22:47.770 --> 00:22:51.900
I'm done living this pointless life

00:22:52.070 --> 00:22:55.900
Let's end it all today

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:00.820
I've taken my last, pointless breath

00:23:01.530 --> 00:23:09.540
To whom it may concern, see ya and goodbye
I killed the person I was yesterday

00:23:09.960 --> 00:23:14.380
To whom it may concern, see ya and goodbye

00:23:14.550 --> 00:23:21.390
A new morning is coming

00:23:37.240 --> 00:23:38.490
Honestly.

00:23:38.650 --> 00:23:41.740
Whose carriage does she think this is?

00:23:42.200 --> 00:23:44.370
The child with two different colored eyes...

00:23:47.040 --> 00:23:50.250
Your Majesty, why are you so exposed?
I've never seen you like this!

00:23:50.420 --> 00:23:52.420
You should try being wild too.

00:23:52.580 --> 00:23:54.790
-How unexpected of you!
-Don't be silly!

00:23:54.960 --> 00:23:58.470
Next time on Rage of Bahamut: Virgin Soul,
"Anatean Holiday."

00:23:58.630 --> 00:24:01.090
-I'm wild and exposed!
-You could say that again!

